OL,3,GNEWSALorry crash shuts M3 northbound
OL,4,Anear Winchester
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M3 is shut after an
OL,7,FHGV crashed and spilled fuel across the
OL,8,Fmotorway.
OL,10,FThe motorway is closed northbound near
OL,11,FWinchester between junction nine for
OL,12,Fthe A34 and junction eight at Popham
OL,13,Fand the A303.
OL,15,FNational Highways said the lorry struck
OL,16,Fthe central reservation at about 01:00
OL,17,FBST rupturing its fuel tank with about
OL,18,F300 litres of diesel poured across the
OL,19,Fcarriageway.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
