OL,3,GNEWSALorry crash shuts M3 northbound
OL,4,Anear Winchester
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motorway needs to be resurfaced and
OL,7,Fis expected to remain closed through
OL,8,Fthe morning rush with traffic being
OL,9,Fdiverted off at junction nine and on to
OL,10,Fthe A34 at Newbury, National Highways
OL,11,Fsays.
